# A checkout of btcpayserver, needed because BTCPayServer.Abstractions is not published on
# NuGet. Point builds at your own copy with -p:BtcpayServerProject=...
/submodules

# NOT ignored, deliberately: dotnet/BtcpayRs.Host/Generated/btcpay.cs
# It is generated by dotnet/regen-bindings.sh, but it is committed so the C# projects build
# without a Rust toolchain, and so changes to the FFI contract show up in review. Regenerate
# and commit it whenever the exported Rust surface changes.

